      "name": "Incite Zeal",
      "type": "trait",
      "_id": "adeptusActor19It",
      "img": "modules/impmal-core/assets/icons/blank.webp",
      "system": {
        "notes": {
          "player": "",
          "gm": "<p>The Arch-Confessor has Advantage on all Presence Tests against Imperial, Infractionist, and Heretic targets. Additionally, they may spend a Fate Point to both enter Frenzy and all Imperial Allies within Medium Range as well.  Spiritual Ministration: The Confessor has Advantage when attempting to learn about the sins of another person, whether by coercion, investigation, or instinct. The Confessor may also preach to allies in order to give them Advantage in resisting the Frightened Condition.  Truest Faith: The Ministorum Priest has 2 points of Fate.   War Hymn: The Ministorum Priest makes a Presence (Leadership) Test as an Action to intone a Hymn of Battle. If they succeed, they may choose an ally that can hear them from the Ecclesiarchy Faction. The next time that ally makes a melee attack, they may make a second melee attack.</p>"
        },
